{% set options = {steps:steps,title:title is defined?title:'Proposed plan'|trans,runLabel:runLabel is defined?runLabel:'Run plan'|trans,variant:variant is defined?variant:'Default',className:className|default('')} %}
<div data-component="agent-plan" data-options="{{ options|json_encode|escape('html_attr') }}" data-default-title="{{ 'Proposed plan'|trans|escape('html_attr') }}" data-default-run-label="{{ 'Run plan'|trans|escape('html_attr') }}" data-label="{{ 'Ativar %title%'|trans|escape('html_attr') }}" data-counter="{{ '%enabled%/%total% steps'|trans|escape('html_attr') }}" class="agent-plan {{ className|default('') }}"><div class="agent-plan__header"><h3></h3><span class="agent-plan__counter"></span></div><ol class="agent-plan__steps"></ol><div class="agent-plan__footer"><button type="button" class="agent-plan__run"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></button></div><template data-prototype="step"><li><div role="group" class="agent-plan__step"><svg class="agent-plan__grip" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="5" r="1"/><circle cx="9" cy="12" r="1"/><circle cx="9" cy="19" r="1"/><circle cx="15" cy="5" r="1"/><circle cx="15" cy="12" r="1"/><circle cx="15" cy="19" r="1"/></svg>{% include '@MauticCore/Components/animated-checkbox.html.twig' with {checked:true,label:''} only %}<span class="agent-plan__body"><span class="agent-plan__title"><span class="agent-plan__index"></span></span></span></div></li></template></div>
